    "title": "Stablecoins Move Fast. The Last Mile Still Breaks",
    "summary": "Raj Kamal of TransFi on why stablecoin settlement still runs into local payout networks, liquidity and FX, and what has to change in regulation next.\nThe post Stablecoins Move Fast. The Last Mile Still Breaks appeared first on The Fintech Times.",
